sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client Application (Python / TypeScript)
    participant API as Gemini Interactions API (/v1beta/interactions)
    participant Model as Gemini 3.8 Flash (Autonomous Agent Engine)
    participant Tool as Local Application Tool

    Note over Client,API: Turn 1: Initial Prompt with Tools & Extended Thinking Enabled
    Client->>API: POST /v1beta/interactions<br/>{model: "gemini-3.8-flash", input: "...", stream: true, tools: [...], generation_config: {thinking_summaries: "auto"}}
    Note over API: HTTP 200 OK (Content-Type: text/event-stream)
    API-->>Client: event: interaction.created<br/>data: {id: "inter_948a2", model: "gemini-3.8-flash", status: "in_progress"}

    rect rgb(238, 246, 255)
        Note over API,Model: Extended Thinking Phase
        API-->>Client: event: step.start<br/>data: {step: {type: "thought"}}
        loop Thought Streaming
            Model-->>API: Stream internal reasoning
            API-->>Client: event: step.delta<br/>data: {delta: {type: "thought_summary", content: {text: "Evaluating database metrics..."}}}
        end
        API-->>Client: event: step.delta<br/>data: {delta: {type: "thought_signature", signature: "eyJhbG..."}}
        API-->>Client: event: step.stop<br/>data: {step: {type: "thought", status: "completed"}}
    end

    rect rgb(254, 247, 237)
        Note over API,Model: Function Call Prediction Phase
        API-->>Client: event: step.start<br/>data: {step: {type: "function_call", name: "get_service_health"}}
        loop Arguments Accumulation
            Model-->>API: Stream JSON arguments delta
            API-->>Client: event: step.delta<br/>data: {delta: {type: "arguments_delta", arguments: '{"serviceName": "db-service"}'}}
        end
        API-->>Client: event: step.stop<br/>data: {step: {type: "function_call", status: "completed"}}
        API-->>Client: event: interaction.completed<br/>data: {id: "inter_948a2", status: "requires_action"}
    end

    Note over Client,Tool: Local Execution Phase
    Client->>Tool: get_service_health(serviceName="db-service")
    Tool-->>Client: {"status": "HEALTHY", "latency_ms": 22.4}

    Note over Client,API: Turn 2: State Resumption via previous_interaction_id
    Client->>API: POST /v1beta/interactions<br/>{previous_interaction_id: "inter_948a2", input: [{type: "function_result", ...}], stream: true}
    API-->>Client: event: step.start<br/>data: {step: {type: "content"}}
    loop Text Response Streaming
        Model-->>API: Stream tokens
        API-->>Client: event: step.delta<br/>data: {delta: {type: "text", text: "The db-service is healthy..."}}
    end
    API-->>Client: event: step.stop<br/>data: {step: {type: "content", status: "completed"}}
    API-->>Client: event: interaction.completed<br/>data: {id: "inter_948a2", status: "completed"}
